  "summary": "Augusta County (VA) Board of Supervisors members Scott Seaton and Steve Grepps have raised concerns about the Sheriff's Office contract with Flock for two ALPR cameras in Fishersville, citing low hit rates and privacy concerns. The Board is expected to discuss the contract at a Sept. 21 staff briefing.",
